    "old": "<li>also: some source figures were replaced by original structure and pathway figures drawn for this book (glycolysis, the citric acid cycle, &beta;-oxidation, the urea cycle, the electron transport chain, ATP synthase and key reactions in Chapters 13&ndash;15), and every source figure that carried a ShareAlike (CC BY-SA) license was replaced with an original figure (for example in Sections 5.3, 5.4, 9.4, 10.7 and 12.4), a few errors in the sources were corrected and are noted where they occur (for example the reversed succinate and fumarate labels in Section 13.1), and source headings were renumbered so heading levels run in order for screen readers;</li>",
    "new": "<li>replaces some source figures with original structure and pathway figures drawn for this book (glycolysis, the citric acid cycle, &beta;-oxidation, the urea cycle, the electron transport chain, ATP synthase and key reactions in Chapters 13&ndash;15), and replaces every source image that carried a ShareAlike (CC BY-SA) license with an original figure or a public-domain or CC0 image (for example in Sections 3.3, 4.7, 5.3, 5.4, 9.4, 10.7, 12.4 and 15.8); source headings were also renumbered so heading levels run in order for screen readers;</li>",
